# Keep analysis outputs (small, useful for reproducibility)
!data/analysis/
!data/analysis/**

# Curated visual-QA evidence for the dashboard/report redesign: 8 selected
# screenshots out of results/visual_qa/ (~2.1 MB total). The remaining shots
# stay ignored via the global *.png rule above. These are per-file negations
# (NOT a blanket !results/visual_qa/**) on purpose, and they MUST stay below
# the *.png rule - git applies the LAST matching pattern.
!results/visual_qa/02_PASS_dashboard.png
!results/visual_qa/02_WARNING_dashboard.png
!results/visual_qa/02_FAIL_dashboard.png
!results/visual_qa/03_PASS_Original.png
!results/visual_qa/03_PASS_Enhanced.png
!results/visual_qa/03_PASS_Grad-CAM.png
!results/visual_qa/03_PASS_Overlay.png
!results/visual_qa/05_report_preview.png

# Screening-report outputs regenerated by every verification run
# (src/reporting/verify_drishti_report_extended.m, ~3.1 MB PDF + ~2.7 MB HTML
# per run). They are deterministic demo artefacts, not evidence in their own
# right - the evidence is the verdict file plus the curated visual_qa PNGs
# above. Without this, each re-verification adds ~6 MB to the repository.
# NOTE: report PDFs/HTMLs already tracked in git stay tracked (ignoring a path
# never untracks it), so the Sep-2026 evidence copies are unaffected.
results/DrishtiScreeningReport_*.html
results/DrishtiScreeningReport_*.pdf

